WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:02.390
What?

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:04.080
Do you mean...

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.890
isn't that a date?

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.540
I'm not sure if you'd call it that.

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:11.890
We're not in love or dating or anything yet.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:15.470
Kanade-chan, how do you feel about him?

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.940
To be honest, I'm not sure.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:23.850
I've been worrying over that recently, 
but I'm finally over it.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.290
I thought that, for now, I should 
just try moving forward.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:30.040
And then, he asked if I'd like 
to go hang out together.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.040
That's amazing! Congratulations!

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:36.050
Kanade-chan, you might be able to 
find someone you love, too, right?

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:39.220
If we analyze that, it will help with 
our research on favorable feeling...

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.590
Meow...

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:44.300
I'm sorry. There, there.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.940
Mreow...

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:48.090
I'd have liked to observe from a distance,

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:50.810
but I shouldn't intrude on your date.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.940
And I want you to have fun, Kanade-chan.

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:55.540
Oh!

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:58.150
If you kept a record of your 
movements, then later...

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:01.490
No. That would put too much 
responsibility on Kanade-chan.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.710
Oh, I guess I have no choice. Go ahead.

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:06.070
Kanade-chan...

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:09.840
It would be better if you came with 
Yukimura-senpai on a double date.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.700
What do you think?

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.820
Wouldn't that be distracting 
for you, Kanade-chan?

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:17.050
That's why you should quietly follow us,

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:21.620
go to the same places we go, and 
do the same kinds of things we do.

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.160
I'm sure you'd have fun!

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.570
I like that idea.

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.230
I have heard your proposal.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:30.480
On the upcoming date, we will use my newly 
devised standard unit of favorable feeling...

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.100
the "Kanade love power."

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:35.530
Huh?

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.760
<b>Science Fell in Love, 
So I Tried to Prove It [r=1-sinθ]</b>

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.760
